question_text:
Match column I with column II w.r.t. the human brain.
\begin{tabular}{|l|l|} \hline Column I & Column II \\ \hline (a) Cerebral aqueduct & (i) Hindbrain \\ (b) Cerebrum, thalamus and hypothalamus & (ii) Brain stem \\ (c) Cerebellum, pons and medulla oblongata & (iii) Midbrain \\ (d) Midbrain, pons and medulla oblongata & (iv) Forebrain \\ \hline \end{tabular}
Choose the option with all the correct matches.
